:''For the unique enemy introduced in these stages, see [[Wicked Axe Cat (Enemy)|Wicked Axe Cat]].''
'''Wicked Axe''' (バトルネコの解放, ''Battle Neko no Kaihō'', '''Unleashing the Battle Cat''') is one of the [[Empress' Research]] maps, appearing only after [[Demon's Park]] has been cleared in full. Upon completion, 50 [[Cat Food]] will be received as a [[Catnip Challenges|mission]] reward. It is one of the three maps that are required to unlock [[The Gates of Aku|Unleashing the Cats]], the others being [[Wicked Cat]] and [[Wicked Tank]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

